@prefix : <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .
@prefix dc: <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix xml: <http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix obda: <https://w3id.org/obda/vocabulary#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix orcid: <http://orcid.org/> .
@prefix story: <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story#> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix ekg-story-service: <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .
@prefix annotation: <https://ekgf.org/ontology/annotation#> .
@base <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
  sh:declare [
      sh:prefix "ekg-story-service" ;
      sh:namespace "https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#"^^xsd:anyURI
  ] ;
    owl:imports story: ;
    rdfs:comment
        "The Story Service Ontology supports the Story Service which is a program that can translate Use Case Stories to executable APIs."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Story Service Ontology"@en .

#################################################################
#    Annotation properties
#################################################################

###  http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator
dc:creator rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty .


###  http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date
dc:date rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty .


#################################################################
#    Object Properties
#################################################################

###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#hasParameter
:hasParameter rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf :parameterFor ;
    rdf:type owl:InverseFunctionalProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Statement ;
    rdfs:range :Parameter ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-01T18:16:18Z"^^xsd:dateTime .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#on
:on rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:range story:Story ;
    rdfs:domain
        [
            rdf:type owl:Class ;
            owl:unionOf
                (
                    :Parameter
                    :Result
                )
        ] .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#parameterFor
:parameterFor rdf:type
        owl:ObjectProperty,
        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Parameter ;
    rdfs:range :Statement ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-01T17:32:57Z"^^xsd:dateTime .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#providedBy
:providedBy rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain story:Story ;
    rdfs:range :StoryService ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-08T00:10:29Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment
        "The execution of any given story can be done by (supplied by) a given (logical) instance of the story Service."@en ;
    rdfs:label "should be supplied by"@en .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#resultFor
:resultFor rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:range story:Story ;
    rdfs:domain :SPARQLResults .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#shouldBeGeneratedBy
:shouldBeGeneratedBy rdf:type
        owl:ObjectProperty,
        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Parameter ;
    rdfs:range :StoryService ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-01T17:25:50Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Identifies the story-service instance expected to generate a parameter. The property is functional; its intended distinction from other parameter-to-service relationships requires modeling review."@en .


#################################################################
#    Data properties
#################################################################

###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#isServiceParameter
:isServiceParameter rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Parameter ;
    rdfs:range xsd:boolean ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-08T00:06:23Z"^^xsd:dateTime .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#parameterDirection
:parameterDirection rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Parameter ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-08T00:03:25Z"^^xsd:dateTime .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#parameterKey
:parameterKey rdf:type
        owl:DatatypeProperty,
        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Parameter ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-01T18:19:13Z"^^xsd:dateTime .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#parameterOp
:parameterOp rdf:type
        owl:DatatypeProperty,
        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Parameter ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-01T18:21:12Z"^^xsd:dateTime .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#parameterType
:parameterType rdf:type
        owl:DatatypeProperty,
        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Parameter ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-01T18:20:08Z"^^xsd:dateTime .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#resultKey
:resultKey rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Parameter ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-07T20:46:55Z"^^xsd:dateTime .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#resultType
:resultType rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Result ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-07T20:51:59Z"^^xsd:dateTime .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#sparqlQueryName
:sparqlQueryName rdf:type
        owl:DatatypeProperty,
        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
    rdfs:domain story:Story ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-07T20:50:13Z"^^xsd:dateTime .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#sparqlStatementFileName
:sparqlStatementFileName rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain story:Story ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-07T20:51:10Z"^^xsd:dateTime .


#################################################################
#    Classes
#################################################################

###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#Parameter
:Parameter rdf:type owl:Class ;
    owl:disjointWith
        :Statement,
        :StoryService ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#Result
:Result rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#SHACLStatement
:SHACLStatement rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :Statement ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-01T18:14:13Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:label "SHACL Statement"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#SPARQLParameter
:SPARQLParameter rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :Parameter ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-01T17:25:05Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:label "SPARQL Parameter"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#SPARQLResults
:SPARQLResults rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :Result ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-07T20:40:18Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:label "SPARQL Results"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#SPARQLStatement
:SPARQLStatement rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :Statement ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-01T17:24:10Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:label "SPARQL Statement"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#Statement
:Statement rdf:type owl:Class ;
    owl:disjointWith :StoryService ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-01T17:24:43Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#StoryService
:StoryService rdf:type owl:Class ;
    dc:creator <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
    dc:date "2020-04-01T17:28:32Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:label "Story Service"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .


#################################################################
#    Annotations
#################################################################



#################################################################
#    Documentation annotations
#################################################################

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#>
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#Parameter>
    rdfs:label "Parameter"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A parameter description used by an executable statement in the story service. Parameters are distinct from statements and service instances."@en .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#Result>
    rdfs:label "Result"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A description of an output supplied by a story-service execution."@en .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#SHACLStatement>
    rdfs:comment "A story-service statement expressed using SHACL."@en .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#SPARQLParameter>
    rdfs:comment "A statement parameter used by a SPARQL story implementation."@en .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#SPARQLResults>
    rdfs:comment "A story-service result description for the output of a SPARQL execution."@en .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#SPARQLStatement>
    rdfs:comment "A story-service statement expressed using SPARQL."@en .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#Statement>
    rdfs:label "Statement"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "An executable statement used by the story service to implement a story, such as a SPARQL or SHACL statement. It is distinct from the service that executes it."@en .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#StoryService>
    rdfs:comment "A logical service that exposes story implementations through executable APIs and supplies the execution context for their statements and parameters."@en .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#hasParameter>
    rdfs:label "Has Parameter"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Associates a statement with one of its parameters; it is the inverse of parameterFor."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#isServiceParameter>
    rdfs:label "Is Service Parameter"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Records whether a parameter is classified as a service parameter by the story-service configuration."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#on>
    rdfs:label "On"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Identifies the story to which a parameter or result description relates."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#parameterDirection>
    rdfs:label "Parameter Direction"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Records the direction assigned to a parameter as a string. The ontology does not declare a controlled set of direction values."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#parameterFor>
    rdfs:label "Parameter For"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Identifies the statement for which a parameter is defined. The functional-property axiom limits a parameter to one statement."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#parameterKey>
    rdfs:label "Parameter Key"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Records the string key by which a parameter is identified in a statement or service configuration."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#parameterOp>
    rdfs:label "Parameter Op"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Records an operation value associated with a parameter. The ontology does not specify its literal datatype or the allowed operations."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#parameterType>
    rdfs:label "Parameter Type"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Records the parameter type identifier used by the story-service configuration. The value is a string rather than a link to an RDF class or datatype."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#providedBy>
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#resultFor>
    rdfs:label "Result For"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Relates a SPARQL result description to the story that produces the result."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#resultKey>
    rdfs:label "Result Key"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Records a result-entry key in the story-service configuration. Its currently declared domain is Parameter, which requires review before treating it as a property restricted to Result."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#resultType>
    rdfs:label "Result Type"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Records the result type identifier used by the story-service configuration as a string."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#shouldBeGeneratedBy>
    rdfs:label "Should Be Generated By"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#sparqlQueryName>
    rdfs:label "Sparql Query Name"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Records the configured name of a story's SPARQL query."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#sparqlStatementFileName>
    rdfs:label "Sparql Statement File Name"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Records the name of the SPARQL statement file associated with a story."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#> .

#################################################################
#    Markdown explanations
#################################################################

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/story-service#>
    annotation:markdownDescription """
# Executing stories

A Story Service is an application that executes stories through their
implementations. The story describes business concept usage; an implementation
binds that usage to technical manifestations such as API names or SPARQL
variables. Reusing a concept preserves its meaning across implementations.

## Input-concept defaults

The story model gives each story its own `StoryInput` usage objects,
referencing shared data element concepts. On each input usage:

| Flag | Meaning when true | Effective value when absent |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `ekg-story:isMandatory` | The input is required for execution. | false |
| `ekg-story:isServerProvided` | The Story Service supplies the input. | false |

The flags are independent. An input can be required for execution and supplied
by the service. Explicit values take precedence over the declared defaults.
The service must reject invalid or conflicting values.

Missing flag assertions remain valid. A Story Service applies the false
defaults when executing a story. Storing explicit false triples is optional;
consumers must not assume that loading or validating the RDF populated them.

The Story Ontology's SHACL shapes declare `sh:defaultValue false` and validate
supplied boolean values with a maximum count of one. SHACL Core default-value
annotations do not populate data, and OWL does not infer false from an
absent assertion. See [SHACL default values](https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/#defaultValue).

## Business concepts and technical bindings

The [Story Ontology](https://ekgf.org/ontology/story#) declares the common usage
class, specialized story predicates, input flags, and validation shapes.
Its input flags describe a particular story's use of a shared concept.
This source's `Parameter`, `Result`, and statement properties describe a
technical statement interface; they do not replace story concept usages or
establish a mapping to a particular execution binding. Variable manifestations
record technical expressions independently of the mechanism used to supply
their values.

For a statement template, a template processor renders the source using the
story's validated input values before parsing and executing the resulting
SPARQL query or update. Support must be limited to explicitly documented
language profiles. Value substitution requires RDF-aware serialization and
escaping; shell evaluation and arbitrary query-fragment insertion are not
input-value substitution. Unresolved placeholders and invalid generated
statements are execution errors. A template-placeholder manifestation does
not select or certify a template engine.

The SPARQL Story Implementation Ontology declares
`StorySPARQLTemplateImplementation`, which selects a template document and
renderer through `hasTemplate` and `usesRenderer`. The document's
`concept:templateLanguage` identifies its source language/profile, and the
renderer declares matching `supportsTemplateLanguage` capabilities. The
placeholder manifestation also identifies its template language. The service
renders that document into a separate SPARQL statement for each invocation;
the generated text is parsed before it is sent for execution.
"""@en .

:StoryService annotation:markdownDescription """
## Execution and defaults

A service application executes stories and applies their input-concept
requirements. Under the agreed contract, it interprets absent
`ekg-story:isMandatory` and `ekg-story:isServerProvided` flags as false on the
story's input usages. The ontology's Markdown description records the full
contract and links to the declared Story vocabulary.
"""@en .
